  "notes": [
    "The per-strategy gate, and the one that shows where the vitality wire is NOT inert. referencePopulation@permissive-breadth 218.125 -> 328.875 (+24.74 SE) and referencePeakPopulation@permissive-breadth 330 -> 556 (+28.70 SE), against denial-warden, narrow-depth, portal-rush and worship-maximizer all flat on population. knowledge-vitality.ts's module note says the wire contributes zero under v1 content; that is true of the twelve enabled cells the other two gates play and FALSE of any strategy that opens more of the grid, and this baseline is the measurement that distinguishes them. The universe remains degenerate in the ways integration round 2 recorded, and this change closes none of them: the v1 rectangle still cannot make food, and founding a construction site is still a god action, so a run with no god actions still spends no stone. What moved is knowledge, and living mages did not move with it. Measured 2026-08-14 on w187/effects-union at 9be84ea, four workers, on a machine several agents were sharing. NO GOLDEN FIXTURE WAS REGENERATED and none needed to be. balance-gate-ascension-v1 was deliberately NOT re-recorded: it carries the same superseded contentHash and will refuse for the same reason, but its Actions job is not required to merge and a 830-1150 s sweep is a separate decision on a separate failure."
